  "body": "**Original comment by agriggio (Bitbucket: [agriggio](https://bitbucket.org/agriggio), GitHub: [agriggio](https://github.com/agriggio)).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nI made a couple of changes that try to better preserve metadata in multiple places \\(exif/iptc/xmp\\). However, for maximum interoperability with other apps that use xmp sidecars \\(such as XnviewMP\\), I suggest you use the following settings in both ART and digiKam:\n\n![](https://bitbucket.org/repo/9pArXyE/images/3244792567-Screenshot%20from%202020-06-03%2011.49.20.jpeg)\n![](https://bitbucket.org/repo/9pArXyE/images/393026713-Screenshot%20from%202020-06-03%2011.50.08.jpeg)\n‌\n",
